{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t四間專營巴士公司申請加價，運輸及物流局局長陳美寶表示，所謂巴士公司「開天殺價」，政府「落地還錢」的說法﹐是反映政府的把關角色。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n陳美寶出席本台節目時表示，考慮巴士加價申請時，不會只是看短暫因素﹐會重視對市民負擔能力及出行選擇的影響。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:54:39.835409+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:38:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:58:23.176022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:26.540160+00:00","content_hash":"9f0a676384b7d3c41a4e27bc50af23e149996d44d7a3f7fad68012cb584c13a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}